@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### List (pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internships?page=1&limit=3

### Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internships?q=developer

### Filter by domain
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internships?domain=Data%20Science

### Detail (replace 1 with an existing ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internships/1

### Create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/internships
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "React Developer Intern",
  "company": "Northstar Apps",
  "domain": "Web Development",
  "location": "Remote",
  "duration_months": 3,
  "stipend": 12000,
  "description": "Build reusable React user interface components.",
  "status": "open"
}

### Full update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/internships/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Junior Backend Intern",
  "company": "CodeSpring",
  "domain": "Backend Development",
  "location": "Remote",
  "duration_months": 4,
  "stipend": 15000,
  "description": "Build and test REST APIs.",
  "status": "open"
}

### Partial update
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/internships/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stipend": 18000
}

### Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/internships/1

### Validation error example
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/internships
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "A",
  "company": "",
  "domain": "Web Development",
  "location": "Remote",
  "duration_months": 0
}
